  the step pyramid stands over 200 feet  high  then the tallest building in the world  its impact on the ancient egyptian  landscape was huge  ten more kings replicated imhotep's  design  determined to attain the same status as  the pharaoh of the first pyramid  their tombs became some of the most  iconic sacred buildings on the planet  each growing the necropolis until it  stretched five miles across the desert  to create a sprawling city of the dead  today imhotep's masterpiece still  dominates the egyptian desert  but while his structures survive no  trace of the man himself  has ever been found  [Music]  you
 

